#: ../../../flagos_homepage/chip_adaptation_guide/_shared/02_cooperation_model/edge.md:2
msgid ""
"Cooperation is divided into three levels: basic, intermediate, and "
"advanced. Chip companies progress through the levels step by step. Given "
"the characteristics of edge chips, no adaptation is required for the "
"FlagCX communication library or the large-model training and inference "
"framework."
